\newcommand{\disclaimerpage}{%
\newpage
\thispagestyle{empty}
\vspace*{2cm}
\begin{center}
    {\Large\sffamily\bfseries\color{brandnavy} Pedagogical Architecture \& How to Use This Book}
\end{center}
\vspace{1cm}
\noindent
This textbook is structured around the six rigorous units of the ECE181 curriculum:
\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=1.8em, itemsep=6pt]
    \item \textbf{Formal Computational Principles:} Every concept begins with formal semantics, memory references, CPython execution models, and asymptotic time complexities.
    \item \textbf{Clean Idiomatic Code:} High-yield code examples illustrate idiomatic Python 3 standards following PEP 8 conventions.
    \item \textbf{Step-by-Step Worked Problems:} Practical algorithms with execution traces, variable state transitions, and memory layout diagrams.
    \item \textbf{Examiner Traps \& Edge Cases:} Callout warnings highlighting standard examination traps, operator precedence gotchas, and indexing subtleties.
\end{enumerate}
\newpage
}
